  "description": "Kim Yu-Jun never imagined his longtime coworker - and secret crush - Kim Jeong-Hyeon would suddenly confess that he’s fallen for a man. Shocked and unsure how to react, Yu-Jun is even more taken aback when Jeong-Hyeon asks him to be his “practice partner” for dating. What begins as a harmless experiment soon grows complicated as their everyday moments blur the line between acting and feeling. In the soft rhythm of shared glances and after-hours conversations, Yu-Jun starts to wonder if he’s the only one pretending. Sometimes, love arrives quietly like two clock hands brushing past each other, almost in sync.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
